<h1>Planet</h1>
</div>

<p>This is the download service for dumps of
<a href="https://openstreetmap.org">OpenStreetMap</a> data, preprocessed for
use with the <a href="https://photon.komoot.io">Photon</a> geocoder.
You can use these dumps to set up your own local Photon server.</p>


